{
  "clause": "ui-interfaces §4 and §5",
  "check": "replay.disposition",
  "about": "The disposition an effect takes on a trip, from the offer's replay policy: an entry for the action, then one for its class, then graded-introspection §9's default. Under vary a read_only effect is performed, since a state fixture has no record to answer it from; an idempotent_write is sandboxed where a declared sandbox serves it and otherwise simulated; a non_idempotent is simulated. After the cut of a continue, everything is performed. The answer is {taken: {disposition, sandbox}}.",
  "vectors": [
    {
      "name": "a read_only effect under vary is performed, since a fixture has no record",
      "input": {
        "offer": {
          "app": "app",
          "instance": "1",
